      "currency": "EUR",
      "description": "Imagine carrying a personal notebook that opens with whatever you want to see first: a new note, your most recent one, or a note captured at your current location. All while staying local and private on your device or, if you choose, always in sync across all your devices through your own iCloud account. \n\nOpen your notebook with a swipe of the cover on your iPhone, by unfolding your iPhone Duo, or with a tap on our beautiful Home Screen widget.\n\nPersonalise it with a collection of 12 handwritten typefaces from Shaped Fonts, or turn your own handwriting into a font you can type with. Choose your paper and ink colours, and decide between lined, grid, or dotted pages.\n\nType anywhere, just like you would write in a real notebook. Curl the pages and draw with your fingers, or use Apple Pencil on iPhone Duo later this year. \n\nNo account required. All your data stays private and secure.",
